@faction wardens
# en: The Wardens
name [2a89ea] = 守护者
# en: The headmistress's quiet circle, sworn to keep the founders' seal. They recruit students only when the seal grows thin.
desc [f1e201] = 院长身边一个安静的小圈子，誓守创始人的封印。只有在封印变薄时，他们才会招募学生。

@faction hollow_cult
# en: The Hollow Cult
name [b781ad] = 空洞教团
# en: Northern families, the Dumonts first among them, who serve the star beneath the lake. Their messenger is the man in grey.
desc [25011f] = 侍奉湖底之星的北境家族，杜蒙家首当其冲。他们的信使就是灰衣人。

@faction midnight_cartographers
# en: The Midnight Cartographers
name [40c563] = 午夜制图社
# en: The club that doesn't exist: students who map the castle's secret passages and share them with almost no one.
desc [14391b] = 那个不存在的社团：一群绘制城堡秘密通道、却几乎从不与人分享的学生。

@faction faculty
# en: The Faculty
name [5b97ac] = 教职员
# en: The professors and staff of Lumenhold: strict, eccentric, and mostly on your side whether you like it or not.
desc [645f6f] = 流明堡的教授与职员：严格、古怪，而且不管你乐不乐意，大多站在你这一边。

@faction conclave
# en: The Conclave of the Seven Towers
name [c832a4] = 七塔议会
# en: The governing body of magic in the realm, headquartered in the capital. Hands out research posts, licences and very long letters.
desc [76fd4f] = 王国魔法界的管理机构，总部设在王都。负责分配研究职位、颁发执照，以及寄来非常长的信。

@faction thornwick
# en: Thornwick Academy
name [74b242] = 荆木学院
# en: The rival school across the hills. Famous for illusionists, tournament grudges and spies who think they're subtle.
desc [28e5ca] = 山那边的对手学校。以幻术师、锦标赛积怨，以及自以为很隐蔽的间谍闻名。
